flowchart TD
    I[FASTQs and sample manifest] --> P[Optional Cutadapt primer removal and family check]
    P --> C[fastp QC and ASV construction]
    R[Sequence and taxonomy references] --> T[Alignment and taxonomy]
    C --> T
    T --> D{Control decontamination enabled?}
    D -->|Yes| QC[Biological-only depth QC; retain controls]
    S[Sample class and pairing metadata] --> QC
    C -->|Raw counts| QC
    QC --> DC[Independent TECH and BIO prevalence; union removal]
    DC --> REF[Reference-based non-target screening]
    REF --> F[FILTER_ASVS: biological abundance and taxonomy filters]
    D -->|No| REF
    F --> M[Metadata-linked microbial tables]
    S --> M
    M --> A[Analysis table preparation]
    A --> V[Diversity: all final biological samples]
    A --> H[Optional study analysis cohort selection]
    H --> E[Indicators and associations]
    H --> N[Networks, modules and topology]
    V --> O
    F -->|Final filtered ASV sequences| L[Optional ASV-to-genome linkage]
    G[Genome and barrnap references] --> L
    L --> N
    E --> O[Tables, plots and run report]
    N --> O
